# Testing Rules

- Backend: pytest + pytest-django. Tests in `<app>/tests/`.
- Frontend (web): Vitest + Testing Library + Playwright. Unit/component tests alongside components in `web/src/`; e2e tests in `web/e2e/`.
- Every new endpoint must have: success, validation error, and auth error tests.
- Every new component must have: render, interaction, state and error tests; axe accessibility assertion.
- Coverage must not decrease on merge. Run `npm run check` before every handoff.
